.TH ZERODDS-AMQP-BRIDGED 1 "" "ZeroDDS" "ZeroDDS Manual"
.SH NAME
zerodds-amqp-bridged \- DDS to AMQP 1.0 bridge daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zerodds-amqp-bridged
[\fB\-\-config\fR \fIFILE\fR]
[\fB\-\-broker\fR \fIURL\fR]
[\fB\-\-domain\fR \fIID\fR]
[\fB\-\-topic\fR \fIDDS=ADDR\fR]...
[\fB\-V\fR | \fB\-h\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zerodds-amqp-bridged
bridges DDS topics to AMQP 1.0 endpoints. Supports SASL ANONYMOUS, PLAIN,
EXTERNAL, TLS, links with sender/receiver settle modes, and
property-based routing. Implements
.IR docs/specs/zerodds-amqp-bridge-daemon-1.0.md .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-config =\fIFILE\fR
YAML config (Spec \(sc3). See
.BR zerodds-amqp-bridged.yaml (5).
.TP
.BR \-\-broker =\fIURL\fR
AMQP broker URL
.RI ( amqp:// ", " amqps:// ).
.TP
.BR \-\-container\-id =\fIID\fR
AMQP container-id.
.TP
.BR \-\-domain =\fIID\fR
DDS Domain ID.
.TP
.BR \-\-sasl\-mechanism =\fINAME\fR
One of
.IR PLAIN ", " SCRAM\-SHA\-256 ", " EXTERNAL ", " ANONYMOUS ", " XOAUTH2 .
.TP
.BR \-\-user =\fIUSER\fR
SASL username.
.TP
.BR \-\-password =\fIPASS\fR
SASL password.
.TP
.BR \-\-tls\-ca =\fIFILE\fR
TLS CA certificate.
.TP
.BR \-\-tls\-cert =\fIFILE\fR
TLS client cert.
.TP
.BR \-\-tls\-key =\fIFILE\fR
TLS client key.
.TP
.BR \-\-topic =\fIDDS=ADDR\fR
Inline topic mapping override.
.TP
.BR \-\-log\-level =\fILEVEL\fR
One of
.IR trace ", " debug ", " info ", " warn ", " error .
.TP
.BR \-\-metrics =\fIADDR\fR
Prometheus listen addr.
.PP
Test hooks. Real options, documented because the program accepts them
and an option nobody can find is one nobody maintains.
.TP
.BR \-\-once
Serve one connection, then exit.
.TP
.BR \-\-connect\-timeout\-ms =\fIN\fR
Give up connecting after \fIN\fR milliseconds.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print version.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show the option synopsis.
.TP
.BR \-\-set " \fIPATH\fR=\fIVALUE\fR"
One setting above every file, repeatable;
.BI + PATH = VALUE
appends to a list.
.TP
.B \-\-check\-config
Validate and print the effective configuration with the origin of every
value, then exit: 0 valid, 1 invalid value or unknown key, 2 unreadable
file, syntax error or include cycle.
.SH SIGNALS
SIGTERM and SIGINT stop the daemon after the drain.
SIGHUP reads the configuration again: a right withdrawn from the topic ACL
applies at once, the TLS material to the next connect; a newly granted
right, changed topics, broker address or domain need a restart and are
logged. A configuration that does not load changes nothing.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT
Optional OTLP endpoint, such as http://localhost:4318.
.TP
.B AMQP_PASSWORD
The SASL password; the setting
.BR amqp.sasl.password ,
above the files, below
.BR \-\-set .
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Normal shutdown, or
.B \-\-check\-config
found the configuration valid.
.TP
.B 1
Invalid configuration: a value, the broker URL, the SASL settings, the TLS
files.
.TP
.B 2
With
.BR \-\-once ,
the broker connection was lost; with
.BR \-\-check\-config ,
a configuration file could not be read or does not parse.
.TP
.B 3
The DDS participant or one of its endpoints could not be created.
.SH FILES
.I /etc/zerodds/amqp-bridged.yaml .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zerodds-amqp-bridged.yaml (5).
